#: app-wizard/elm/Wizard/Pages/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:896
#: app-wizard/elm/Wizard/Pages/KMEditor/Migration/View.elm:925
msgid "Request HTTP Headers"
msgstr "Glave zahtevka HTTP"

#: app-wizard/elm/Wizard/Pages/KMEditor/Editor/Components/KMEditor.elm:2196
msgid "HTTP headers to include in the API request. You can use `{{ q }}` for the search term and `{{ variables.name }}` for referencing variables and `{{ secrets.name }}` for secrets."
